# Composition. The `Retrying` row delegates two of its three columns to the
# child machine in `retry.tbl`, and handles the third statically.
#
# Note that the row still lists every column. Coverage is never inherited
# silently: a parent does not get to say "everything else goes to the child",
# which would be the wildcard this library exists to remove wearing a hat.

machine Job
initial Idle
states  Idle Retrying Done
actions Run Tick Cancel

Idle     | HANDLE           | IGNORE           | IGNORE
Retrying | DELEGATE(retry)  | DELEGATE(retry)  | GO(Done, Log)
Done     | IGNORE           | IGNORE           | IGNORE
